WEBVTT

00:06:27.014 --> 00:06:31.005
because, according to them,
Congolese communities are too small

00:06:31.029 --> 00:06:33.568
to make providing them with electricity

00:06:34.123 --> 00:06:36.336
a viable concern.

00:06:38.174 --> 00:06:39.953
The solution?

00:06:39.977 --> 00:06:42.921
Africa must become a knowledge society,

00:06:42.945 --> 00:06:46.110
a defining characteristic
of the modern age.

00:06:46.866 --> 00:06:52.175
We neither are, nor are we
on the path to becoming,

00:06:52.199 --> 00:06:53.661
a knowledge society.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.022
Things have not always been this way

00:06:58.696 --> 00:07:01.631
when it comes to knowledge
production and Africa.